723	  Run `grep -n writeBits zig-parquet/src -r` before deleting `writeBits`.
724	- New test: round trip through `rle.decode` for bit widths 1..31, counts {1, 8, 9, 100, 1000}
725	  (the decoder is now fast, so this also cross-checks 2.1).
726	- Acceptance: tests pass on both versions; str_dict write +10% or more (indices at bit width 7);
727	  `file_MB` unchanged.
