782	  95%, 100%} plus the bench pattern (`i % 3 == 2` is null): build `[]Optional(i64)` and the matching
783	  `[]bool`, then assert `appendDefLevelsWithLength` output == `encodeDefLevelsWithLength(bool slice)`.
784	- Acceptance: test passes on both versions (no bench change expected yet).
