837	  general path built by hand: split into `non_null` + `is_defined`, then
838	  `writeDataPageTypedWithEncoding(allocator, T, non_null, is_defined, is_optional, .plain)`. Do this
839	  for T = i64, f32, bool. For byte arrays, compare against `encodeByteArraysWithEncoding` +
